{"id":"c38d15bb3c121301","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-truth-model-general.md","title":"一般真理模型","display":"df-truth-model-general — 一般真理模型","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-truth-model-general","aliases":["91-df-truth-model-general","91-df-general-truth-model"],"display":"df-truth-model-general — 一般真理模型","depends_on":["[[91-df-structure]]","[[91-df-language-with-truth]]","[[91-df-truth-predicate]]","[[91-df-truth-expansion]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-truth-model-general"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-truth-model-general</span><span>91-df-general-truth-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-truth-model-general — 一般真理模型"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c8e718c83a9cc331\" href=\"?note=c8e718c83a9cc331\" title=\"91-df-structure\">91-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"97fe560478d37064\" href=\"?note=97fe560478d37064\" title=\"91-df-language-with-truth\">91-df-language-with-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0838e653809dc677\" href=\"?note=0838e653809dc677\" title=\"91-df-truth-predicate\">91-df-truth-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7f5043d4200f56d1\" href=\"?note=7f5043d4200f56d1\" title=\"91-df-truth-expansion\">91-df-truth-expansion</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-truth-model-general-—-一般真理模型-$\\mathfrak{M}_T$\">df-truth-model-general — 一般真理模型 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{M}_T\">\\(\\mathfrak{M}_T\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{M}_0\\in\\operatorname{Str}(\\mathcal L_0)\">\\(\\mathfrak{M}_0\\in\\operatorname{Str}(\\mathcal L_0)\\)</span> (任意基础结构)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_T=\\mathcal L_0\\cup\\{T\\}\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_T=\\mathcal L_0\\cup\\{T\\}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 为新的一元关系符号</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (真理谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0838e653809dc677\" href=\"?note=0838e653809dc677\" title=\"91-df-truth-predicate\">91-df-truth-predicate</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}model\\text{-}general}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{TruthExp}_{\\mathcal L_T}(\\mathfrak M_0)\n\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\mathfrak M\\in\\operatorname{Str}(\\mathcal L_T)\n\\;\\middle|\\;\n\\mathfrak M\\upharpoonright\\mathcal L_0=\\mathfrak M_0\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}model\\text{-}general}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{TruthExp}_{\\mathcal L_T}(\\mathfrak M_0)\n\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\mathfrak M\\in\\operatorname{Str}(\\mathcal L_T)\n\\;\\middle|\\;\n\\mathfrak M\\upharpoonright\\mathcal L_0=\\mathfrak M_0\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>而且映射</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq|\\mathfrak M_0|\n\\longmapsto\n\\mathfrak M_0[\\Gamma]\\in\n\\operatorname{TruthExp}_{\\mathcal L_T}(\\mathfrak M_0),\n\\qquad\nT^{\\mathfrak M_0[\\Gamma]}=\\Gamma,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\subseteq|\\mathfrak M_0|\n\\longmapsto\n\\mathfrak M_0[\\Gamma]\\in\n\\operatorname{TruthExp}_{\\mathcal L_T}(\\mathfrak M_0),\n\\qquad\nT^{\\mathfrak M_0[\\Gamma]}=\\Gamma,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(|\\mathfrak M_0|)\">\\(\\mathcal P(|\\mathfrak M_0|)\\)</span> 与该扩张类之间的双射。对闭\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_0\">\\(\\mathcal L_0\\)</span>-项 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span>，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M_0[\\Gamma]\\models T(t)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\llbracket t\\rrbracket_{\\mathfrak M_0}\\in\\Gamma.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak M_0[\\Gamma]\\models T(t)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\llbracket t\\rrbracket_{\\mathfrak M_0}\\in\\Gamma.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TruthExp}_{\\mathcal L_T}(\\mathfrak M_0)\">\\(\\operatorname{TruthExp}_{\\mathcal L_T}(\\mathfrak M_0)\\)</span> :\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M_0\">\\(\\mathfrak M_0\\)</span> 的全部真理语言扩张</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> : 真理外延（真句子编码的集合）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^{\\mathfrak{M}_T}\">\\(T^{\\mathfrak{M}_T}\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>在模型中的解释</li>\n</ul>\n<p>说明：一般真理模型是在基础算术模型上添加真理谓词解释得到的扩展模型。真理谓词的外延<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span>决定哪些句子被认为&quot;真&quot;。</p>\n<p>真理模型的构成：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>成分</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>论域</td>\n<td>$</td>\n<td>\\mathfrak M_0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>基础符号解释</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M_0\">\\(\\mathfrak M_0\\)</span></td>\n<td>扩张中保持不变</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>真理外延</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span></td>\n<td>解释<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>谓词</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>不同类型的真理模型：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span>的选择</th>\n<th>特征</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>任意真理扩展</td>\n<td>任意 $\\Gamma\\subseteq</td>\n<td>\\mathfrak M_0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>固定点扩展</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J(\\Gamma)=\\Gamma\">\\(J(\\Gamma)=\\Gamma\\)</span></td>\n<td>在已给算术编码与跳跃时为 KF 的预期模型候选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最小固定点</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_{\\min}\">\\(\\Gamma_{\\min}\\)</span></td>\n<td>最小的固定点解释</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>析取式模型</td>\n<td>满足相应 T-双条件</td>\n<td>TB/UTB 的模型</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>真理模型与理论的关系：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>理论</th>\n<th>模型条件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>TB</td>\n<td>对每个基础语言句子满足相应 T-双条件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UTB</td>\n<td>对基础语言公式及参数满足统一双条件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>KF</td>\n<td>预期模型由强 Kleene 固定点给出，不限于最小固定点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FS</td>\n<td>由其公理/规则判定模型；修正序列属于另一类语义方案</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>真理外延<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span>的条件：\n对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span>，上述结构定义都成立；只有在要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M_T\">\\(\\mathfrak M_T\\)</span> 成为某个特定真理理论的模型时，才额外施加基础真理、组合闭包或固定点条件。</p>\n<p>真理外延的包含只比较同一基础模型上的谓词解释：\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_1\\subseteq\\Gamma_2\">\\(\\Gamma_1\\subseteq\\Gamma_2\\)</span> 不自动给出两个结构之间的初等嵌入，也不使\n所有含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 公式的满足关系单调；例如否定出现会反转这种直觉。\n只有对已证明关于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 单调的公式类，才能从外延包含推出真值保持。</p>\n<p>定义的意义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>提供真理理论的语义基础</li>\n<li>连接语法和语义</li>\n<li>区分不同真理理论的关键</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-truth-model-general-—-一般真理模型-$\\mathfrak{M}_T$","text":"df-truth-model-general — 一般真理模型 $\\mathfrak{M}_T$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c8e718c83a9cc331","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-language-with-truth","status":"resolved","id":"97fe560478d37064","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-language-with-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"0838e653809dc677","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-expansion","status":"resolved","id":"7f5043d4200f56d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-expansion]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"0838e653809dc677","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T$ (真理谓词, see [[91-df-truth-predicate]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak{M}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak{M}_0\\in\\operatorname{Str}(\\mathcal L_0)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{L}_T=\\mathcal L_0\\cup\\{T\\}","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}model\\text{-}general}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{TruthExp}_{\\mathcal L_T}(\\mathfrak M_0)\n\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\mathfrak M\\in\\operatorname{Str}(\\mathcal L_T)\n\\;\\middle|\\;\n\\mathfrak M\\upharpoonright\\mathcal L_0=\\mathfrak M_0\n\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\subseteq|\\mathfrak M_0|\n\\longmapsto\n\\mathfrak M_0[\\Gamma]\\in\n\\operatorname{TruthExp}_{\\mathcal L_T}(\\mathfrak M_0),\n\\qquad\nT^{\\mathfrak M_0[\\Gamma]}=\\Gamma,","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(|\\mathfrak M_0|)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_0","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M_0[\\Gamma]\\models T(t)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\llbracket t\\rrbracket_{\\mathfrak M_0}\\in\\Gamma.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TruthExp}_{\\mathcal L_T}(\\mathfrak M_0)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"T^{\\mathfrak{M}_T}","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"J(\\Gamma)=\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_{\\min}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_1\\subseteq\\Gamma_2","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false}],"bytes":3525,"backlinks":[{"id":"15f80240a42e9796","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-model-general]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-96","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conjunction-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-conservative-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conservativity-proof.md]]\n[[9